        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Here is a list of things that I know peeps want to get done and we should schedule some events around .</P><P>1. I know Iinaru wants another forest loop and that spell from great devide celestial healing or what ever. The spell drops of guardian wurms and the earring off fm giants.</P><P>2. Relendor(mispelling not count) is interested in a epic piece out of kedge keep.(never been to kedge myself)</P><P>3. Merilla would like a tomb from kaesora.<BR>(this should be first on the list, she has attempted to do it over and over again, we will get you that tomb merilla) </P><P>4  Kevralyn would like to kill some high lvl mob in the hole.</P><P>5 Abyn and I really drool over the idea of droping that alasauruas in oot.</P><P>6. Someone metitioned they want to try out COM(never been there either lol).</P><P>7. Would like to get us keys to selibis.</P><P>I know theres more so right em down. Not a bunch of stuff but will give us something to aim for and have some good times in the process. Just so we dont end up <img src=icon_smile_dead.gif border=0 align=middle></P><P>Megadien Zarakus<BR>51th Level Champion<BR>LOREKEEPERS of eci.<BR>My blades lust for blood.</P><P>Edited by - megadien on 07 Apr 2001  02:48:17</font></td>
      </tr>

