        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?method=ReplyQuote&REPLY_ID=5553&TOPIC_ID=970&FORUM_ID=4&CAT_ID=1&Forum_Title=The+Round+Table&Topic_Title=Things+for+the+month+of+04&M="><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I have 3 more weeks of school this semester, so after that I will have much more time to do these things.  Sorry I haven't been around as much as normal, I've been really busy.</P><P>I know Iinaru got celestial healing already, I was there *hug Iinaru* and I think that Renaldar also needs the hilt from Mistmoore for his Soulfire - unless he got it since Thursday when I was on.</P><P>I agree we need to get Sebilis keys, it would be fun to get on early so we can get a group of LK in a good spot.  I haven't spent much time at all in Seb.  I know that Browso, Senina, and myself already have keys, probably others.</P><P>I'm always up for CoM, I still need to find that darn a human skeleton hehe.</P><P>Ealadan Azurefire<BR>Keeper of Tears<BR>Eyes of Tunare<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
